<title>UK: Merrill Lynch raises 300 million SFR via two FRNs.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch raises 300 million SFR via two FRNs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch and Co Inc has issued two three-year FRNS, both for 150 million Swiss francs, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>One deal pays three-month LIBOR plus 6.25 basis points, the other six-month LIBOR plus 6.25 b.p. Both were priced at par.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
